-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Owner       Played by Jon Attree in JNext through the real loader,
              2026-11-03

  Replay      2 bot recordings, 16000 frames: IDENTICAL, 12770 plots, 2885156
              Layer 2 pixels. Dean's recording from its own snapshot:
              IDENTICAL. Negative controls 3/3 detected

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: reaches play; a yellow figure stays on
              the TOUGH LUCK game over screen, not on the plain build. Nobody
              played; with the loading screen: JNext 1.1.104 headless through
              the real loader, MD5 exact, reached the screen, the game and
              play frames, viewed; no person played it

  Coverage    Bots walk only: few rooms, no puzzles. Game over screen not in
              the replays and a figure stays on it in JNext. Run as a 128K
              wrapper of this file's RAM; Enhanced set moved by byte
              difference from build/bigset's on Dean's build, whose target a
              player cannot get: no byte in conflict; the set itself not
              replayed; loading screen stub added in bank 29, 2026-11-03: the
              replay and hardware lines are of the build without it, whose
              game memory the stub restores at the original start; the stub is
              emulator-tested only

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
